{{Documentation}}
This template displays numbers using in-game images. Any non-numeric characters are omitted.

==Parameters==
<pre>
{{BCNum|number|size=|mode=}}
</pre>

<code>number</code> is the number to display. The parameter <code>size</code> specifies the height in pixels for the resulting number. <code>mode</code> is a string specifying the type of number to display. If omitted, the <code>size</code> parameter defaults to the size in the initial spritesheet, and <code>mode</code> becomes <code>white-med</code>. Below shows the different modes:

{| class="article-table"
|'''Mode'''
|'''Wikitext'''
|'''Result'''
